### ===========================================================
### Ollama Cloud examples
### Use the hosted Ollama Cloud API: https://ollama.com
### ===========================================================

@baseUrl = https://ollama.com
@apiKey = {{OLLAMA_API_KEY}}
#@model = llama3.1
@model = gpt-oss:20b

# Add this in VS Code user settings (Settings JSON):
# "rest-client.environmentVariables": {
#   "local": {
#     "OLLAMA_API_KEY": "your-api-key-here"
#   }
# }
# Then the value above resolves from {{OLLAMA_API_KEY}}.

# NOTE:
# Ollama Cloud uses the same OpenAI-compatible request format as Ollama,
# but you usually send your API key in Authorization: Bearer header when
# using the hosted service. If your endpoint differs, update @baseUrl.

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# MODELS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List available models
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

###

### Generate text
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "{{model}}",
  "prompt": "Write a short welcome message for a developer using Ollama Cloud.",
  "stream": false
}

###

### Chat completion
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "{{model}}",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "Explain what a managed LLM service is in 2 sentences." }
  ],
  "stream": false
}

###

### Streaming chat completion
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "{{model}}",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "Count from 1 to 5." }
  ],
  "stream": true
}

###

### OpenAI-compatible chat style on Ollama Cloud
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "{{model}}",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant." },
    { "role": "user", "content": "Reply with one short sentence." }
  ],
  "temperature": 0.7
}

###

### OpenAI-compatible embeddings
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/embeddings
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "nomic-embed-text",
  "input": "This is a sample embedding request for Ollama Cloud."
}
